# The detail split out of CLAUDE.md on 2026-08-08 to get it under budget.
# Ignored for the same reason CLAUDE.md is: these carry device UDIDs, the deploy
# loop, and internal process notes, and this repo is public. Mirrored to
# ~/Developer/.state/openprompter/docs/ so losing the directory does not lose them.
#
# NOTE: docs/camera-and-recording.md contains no credentials or strategy — it is
# pure iOS API archaeology and would genuinely help contributors. Publishing that
